WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.213
Bajie and Wujing swung their weapons at the demon.

2
00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:08.518
[g@"Ha!" The demon laughed.

3
00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:11.808
"I'm much too powerful for you!"@g]

4
00:00:11.809 --> 00:00:15.354
From inside the cymbals, Wukong heard the fight.

5
00:00:15.355 --> 00:00:19.249
He heard grunts and the sounds of weapons clashing.

6
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:22.357
The Tang Monk cried, "No!"

7
00:00:22.358 --> 00:00:24.950
Then there was silence.

8
00:00:24.951 --> 00:00:28.319
[g@"What happened out there?" shouted Wukong.

9
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.106
There was no answer.@g]

10
00:00:31.107 --> 00:00:37.569
The monkey punched and kicked the inside of the cymbals for hours.

11
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.922
But the two cymbals would not come apart.

12
00:00:41.923 --> 00:00:45.255
[g@"This is terrible," he said to himself.

13
00:00:45.256 --> 00:00:47.826
"How will I get out of here?"@g]

14
00:00:47.827 --> 00:00:52.344
The monkey was about to strike the cymbals again when he heard a voice.

15
00:00:52.345 --> 00:00:55.693
"Wukong, are you in there?"

16
00:00:55.694 --> 00:00:58.550
"Who is that?" Wukong asked.

17
00:00:58.551 --> 00:01:01.584
"I'm the Gold Dragon," said the voice.

18
00:01:01.585 --> 00:01:04.260
"The Jade Emperor sent me to help you.

19
00:01:04.261 --> 00:01:11.350
I'll wedge my horn between the cymbals and pry them apart."

20
00:01:11.351 --> 00:01:14.350
"Please hurry!" said Wukong.

21
00:01:14.351 --> 00:01:18.024
Slowly the dragon's horn poked through.

22
00:01:18.025 --> 00:01:22.096
But the cymbals were still tightly clasped together.

23
00:01:22.097 --> 00:01:26.176
Wukong groaned. "I can't escape."

24
00:01:26.177 --> 00:01:30.640
"Maybe we can find another way to pry the cymbals apart," said the dragon.

25
00:01:30.641 --> 00:01:34.509
"Actually, I have a different idea," said the monkey.

26
00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:39.756
Wukong turned his iron bar into a drill.

27
00:01:39.757 --> 00:01:45.573
He made a hole in the dragon's horn.

28
00:01:45.574 --> 00:01:50.841
Then he made himself tiny and climbed into the hole.

29
00:01:50.842 --> 00:01:55.535
"Pull your horn out now!" said Wukong.

30
00:01:55.536 --> 00:02:01.472
The dragon pulled and pulled and finally got his horn out.

31
00:02:01.473 --> 00:02:07.005
The monkey jumped out of the hole and returned to his normal size.

32
00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:09.297
[g@"Thank you," said Wukong.

33
00:02:09.298 --> 00:02:11.596
"Now we must free my friends."@g]

34
00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:14.355
[g@"We have to be quiet," said the dragon.

35
00:02:14.356 --> 00:02:16.703
"The demon is sleeping."@g]

36
00:02:16.704 --> 00:02:18.227
[g@Wukong nodded.

37
00:02:18.228 --> 00:02:22.419
Then he turned toward the cymbals and raised his iron bar.@g]

38
00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:26.517
[i@Smash!@i] The cymbals shattered.

39
00:02:26.518 --> 00:02:29.795
"Why did you do that?" cried the dragon.

40
00:02:29.796 --> 00:02:32.484
Wukong shrugged. "I was angry."

41
00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.163
[g@The demon stormed into the room.

42
00:02:35.164 --> 00:02:39.123
"Sun Wukong! How did you escape?"@g]

43
00:02:39.124 --> 00:02:41.904
[g@"Who are you?" demanded Wukong.

44
00:02:41.905 --> 00:02:44.405
"How do you know my name?"@g]

45
00:02:44.406 --> 00:02:48.373
"My name is Yellow Brows," said the demon.

46
00:02:48.374 --> 00:02:52.960
"I've been waiting for you and the Tang Monk to pass by my mountain."

47
00:02:52.961 --> 00:02:56.298
Wukong narrowed his eyes. "Why?"

48
00:02:56.299 --> 00:02:59.190
"I'm a Buddhist," said the demon.

49
00:02:59.191 --> 00:03:04.936
"I plan to go to the Western Paradise and get the True Scriptures myself."

50
00:03:04.937 --> 00:03:07.841
"You can't do that!" shouted Wukong.

51
00:03:07.842 --> 00:03:11.358
The monkey and the dragon charged toward the demon.

52
00:03:11.359 --> 00:03:17.056
The demon pulled a cloth from his robe and threw it.

53
00:03:17.057 --> 00:03:25.344
The cloth wrapped around Wukong and the dragon, and then became very small.

54
00:03:25.345 --> 00:03:27.692
Soon they were tied up in a room.

55
00:03:27.693 --> 00:03:32.209
The Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing were also in the room.

56
00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.828
Their bags were lying in a corner.

57
00:03:34.829 --> 00:03:38.403
"I'm sorry for not believing you, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

58
00:03:38.404 --> 00:03:41.450
"You suspected this place was dangerous."

59
00:03:41.451 --> 00:03:44.394
"Don't worry about that, Master," said the monkey.

60
00:03:44.395 --> 00:03:47.514
"We must escape as soon as the demon goes back to sleep.

61
00:03:47.515 --> 00:03:52.141
He plans to get the True Scriptures himself."

62
00:03:52.142 --> 00:03:55.144
The group waited for a while.

63
00:03:55.145 --> 00:04:00.165
Finally Wukong made himself tiny and slipped out from his ropes.

64
00:04:00.166 --> 00:04:03.998
He untied his companions and the dragon.

65
00:04:03.999 --> 00:04:06.369
[g@"Let's go," the monkey whispered.

66
00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.656
"Bajie, get the bags."@g]

67
00:04:08.657 --> 00:04:13.702
"Everyone, be quiet," the dragon warned.

68
00:04:13.703 --> 00:04:18.140
They tiptoed through the monastery and were soon outside.

69
00:04:18.141 --> 00:04:21.292
[g@Wukong looked at Bajie and frowned.

70
00:04:21.293 --> 00:04:23.391
"Where are the bags?"@g]

71
00:04:23.392 --> 00:04:25.721
[g@The pig moaned.

72
00:04:25.722 --> 00:04:27.941
"I forgot them."@g]

73
00:04:27.942 --> 00:04:34.064
"Master's special robe is in one of those bags!" Wukong sighed.

74
00:04:34.065 --> 00:04:38.874
"Wait here. I'll go back in and get them."

75
00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:43.011
The monkey quietly hurried back to the room and grabbed the bags.

76
00:04:43.012 --> 00:04:48.706
But as he was leaving, he tripped and knocked over a statue. [i@Bang!@i]

77
00:04:48.707 --> 00:04:53.044
From another room Yellow Brows shouted, "What was that?"

78
00:04:53.045 --> 00:04:59.520
Wukong gulped. "Uh-oh."

